{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Task: Generate a custom Liquid section for a "Comparison Grid" between "Traditional Dashboards" and "Flow Decisioning."
    
    Layout Structure:
    
    Two horizontal columns (flexbox).
    
    Left Column (Legacy): Title: "Passive Dashboards". Status Tag: "TRADITIONAL". Metric: "12-18 Hour Lag". List 4 items starting with a Red "✕" icon.
    
    Right Column (Flow): Title: "Flow Decisioning". Status Tag: "⚡ LIVE ACTIVE". Metric: "< 2 Minute Action". Highlight this metric in Neon Green (#00D66F). List 4 items starting with a Green "✓" icon.
    
    Bottom Element (Inside Right Column): A horizontal Progress Bar with a dual-color gradient (Purple to Green), labeled "Response Latency: Ultra-Low".
    
    Styling Requirements:
    
    Container: Max-width 1200px, 40px padding, rounded corners 16px.
    
    Colors: Left column should have a light gray border. Right column must have a Deep Navy background (#0A2540) with White text to emphasize authority.
    
    Typography: Use Bold Sans-serif. Metrics must be large (32px+).
    
    Responsive: Stack the columns vertically on mobile devices.
    
    Content for Lists:
    
    Left: Static Insights, Manual Interpretation, Inconsistent Execution, Reactive Management.
    
    Right: Real-Time Actionable, Automated Dispatch, +140% Consistency Lift, Proactive Command.
    
    Technical: Output as a standalone Custom Liquid block. Do not use external libraries., can you add a progress bar on the left bottom as well but make it red and only  a little bit progress to make it comparision and add 12-18hr above to progress bar but on the right side left side is text 
{% enddoc %}
